{"title":"使用CloudFlare-Worker搭建vless节点","uid":"651e920b1edccec24beab30b3708ef91","slug":"使用CloudFlare-Worker搭建vless节点","date":"2025-07-06T05:07:03.000Z","updated":"2025-07-06T07:01:14.453Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/使用CloudFlare-Worker搭建vless节点.json","keywords":null,"cover":[],"content":"<h1 id=\"准备账号\"><a href=\"#准备账号\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"准备账号\"></a>准备账号</h1><p>这个我按照惯例还是不多说了，CloudFlare 账号，在主页直接点免费开始使用。</p>\n<p>CloudFlare官网：<a href=\"https://www.cloudflare.com/zh-cn/\">https://www.cloudflare.com/zh-cn/</a></p>\n<p>注册好以后就会直接跳转到账号的控制面板。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/d04VjFZx/vpn-1.png\" alt=\"控制面板\"></p>\n<h1 id=\"创建-CloudFlare-Page\"><a href=\"#创建-CloudFlare-Page\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"创建 CloudFlare Page\"></a>创建 CloudFlare Page</h1><p>我们在回到 CloudFlare 账号的控制面板左边栏往下滑，找到“计算（Workers）”，点击它进入 Workers &amp; Pages 页面。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/PxJr67mr/vpn-2.png\" alt=\"Workers &amp; Pages页面\"></p>\n<p>点击右上角的“创建”按钮，进入下面这个页面</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/25z5WyyW/vpn-3.png\" alt=\"创建页面\"></p>\n<p>点击上面的 Pages ，选择使用直接上传，点击“开始使用”</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/t4rv4m5N/Snipaste-2025-07-06-13-09-30.png\" alt=\"Pages页面\"></p>\n<p>为项目命名之后会要求你上传资产，从下面的这个页面下载压缩包，上传到上面（不要解压）。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/YqLC3J4h/Snipaste-2025-07-06-13-48-16.png\" alt=\"上传页面\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://tutt.lanzouh.com/iNuzw227k25e\">vless_workers.zip</a></p>\n<p>点击部署站点。</p>\n<h1 id=\"自定义域名\"><a href=\"#自定义域名\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"自定义域名\"></a>自定义域名</h1><p>这个时候如果成功了就会跳出来这个页面：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/4x4FZTz3/Snipaste-2025-07-06-13-19-22.png\" alt=\"成功\"></p>\n<p>往下滑点击“添加自定义域”，跳转到自定义域名页面</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/TPp7LqNM/Snipaste-2025-07-06-13-20-44.png\" alt=\"自定义域名页面\"></p>\n<p>点击设置自定义域，输入你想要绑定的域名</p>\n<p>注意：输入的域名一定要绑定在 CloudFlare 你的账号下面，否则就不能绑定。</p>\n<p>点击“继续”，再点击“激活域”，CloudFlare 会自动帮你添加一个 CNAME 记录。</p>\n<p>这个时候CloudFlare 会验证域名，我们先不管他，先去设置UUID。</p>\n<h1 id=\"设置UUID\"><a href=\"#设置UUID\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"设置UUID\"></a>设置UUID</h1><p>打开下面的网站，生成一下 UUID，它会一次性生成5个，随便找一个复制就行了。这个 UUID 最好记住，后面要用。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://1024tools.com/uuid\">UUID生成器</a></p>\n<p>再回到 CloudFlare 你的 Page 页面，点击设置，在变量与机密那里点击“添加”。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/1z2Wpnbg/Snipaste-2025-07-06-13-28-22.png\" alt=\"变量与机密页面\"></p>\n<p>变量名称填写“UUID”（一定要大写），值填刚刚复制的 UUID。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/C18cJMVc/Snipaste-2025-07-06-13-29-45.png\" alt=\"添加变量与机密\"></p>\n<p>点击创建部署，重新上传刚刚的文件就行。</p>\n<h1 id=\"使用\"><a href=\"#使用\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"使用\"></a>使用</h1><p>这里以 V2rayN 举例，V2rayNG 同理，其他的没用过。</p>\n<p>进入你刚才绑定的自定义域名，在域名后面加一个&#x2F;，更上刚才输入的 UUID，就能够进入节点配置页面了。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/3NHnqM8Y/Snipaste-2025-07-06-13-34-39.png\" alt=\"节点配置页面\"></p>\n<p>复制下面的节点配置（两个都行），打开V2rayN，点击“配置文件”，再点击“从剪贴板导入分享链接”就可以啦！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/MHbd2sHR/Snipaste-2025-07-06-13-37-17.png\" alt=\"V2rayN\"></p>\n<p>更多日常使用配置请参考<a href=\"V2rayN%EF%BC%88%E7%94%B5%E8%84%91%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E8%AE%A2%E9%98%85%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8A%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8\">这篇文章</a>哦！</p>\n","feature":true,"text":"准备账号这个我按照惯例还是不多说了，CloudFlare 账号，在主页直接点免费开始使用。 CloudFlare官网：https://www.cloudflar...","permalink":"/post/使用CloudFlare-Worker搭建vless节点","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":876,"symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"教程","slug":"教程","count":5,"path":"api/categories/教程.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"V2rayN","slug":"V2rayN","count":2,"path":"api/tags/V2rayN.json"},{"name":"CloudFlare","slug":"CloudFlare","count":3,"path":"api/tags/CloudFlare.json"},{"name":"Vless","slug":"Vless","count":1,"path":"api/tags/Vless.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7\"><span class=\"toc-text\">准备账号</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA-CloudFlare-Page\"><span class=\"toc-text\">创建 CloudFlare Page</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%9F%9F%E5%90%8D\"><span class=\"toc-text\">自定义域名</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AEUUID\"><span class=\"toc-text\">设置UUID</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8\"><span class=\"toc-text\">使用</span></a></li></ol>","author":{"name":"Meteorite","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"img/avatar.png","link":"/","description":"Say Hello to the World!","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/yangle-q","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"https://www.zhihu.com/people/84-92-73-30","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{"bilibili":{"icon":"/img/bilibili.svg","link":"https://space.bilibili.com/3546587441662405"},"email":{"icon":"/img/mail.svg","link":"mailto:yangle.q@outlook.com"}}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{},"next_post":{"title":"V2rayNG（android版）配置订阅以及日常使用","uid":"4f3022865930ce5e4b73c1a58f9d0b2b","slug":"V2rayN（android版）配置订阅以及日常使用","date":"2025-07-05T16:58:15.000Z","updated":"2025-07-06T05:40:38.343Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/V2rayN（android版）配置订阅以及日常使用.json","keywords":null,"cover":[],"text":" ⚠️ 转载说明： 本文转载自我的主博客 下载V2rayN这里提供了三种下载方式供大家选择~ 通过GitHub下载项目GitHub仓库：https://githu...","permalink":"/post/V2rayN（android版）配置订阅以及日常使用","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"1.5k","symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"教程","slug":"教程","count":5,"path":"api/categories/教程.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"V2ray","slug":"V2ray","count":2,"path":"api/tags/V2ray.json"},{"name":"Edgetunnel","slug":"Edgetunnel","count":3,"path":"api/tags/Edgetunnel.json"}],"author":{"name":"Meteorite","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"img/avatar.png","link":"/","description":"Say Hello to the World!","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/yangle-q","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu